    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble UP!</strong> is a fast-paced, Tetris-inspired puzzle game where a steady stream of bubbles is drawn to your core. Match colors, pop groups, and trigger chain reactions to score big!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER FOUR CORE MECHANICS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Match bubbles</strong> by color</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Pop groups</strong> to clear space and earn points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Chain combos</strong> to multiply points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06\ufe0f <strong>Level up</strong> to unlock powerful effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRIGGER UNIQUE EVENTS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Bubble Mania</strong> kicks in when your bubble gets low, speeding up the action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf08 Bubble Frenzy</strong> activates when you level up, unleashing high-score potential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udee7\u00a0<strong>Multibubble</strong> explodes onto the screen when you clear your core completely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game speeds up, you'll need sharp reflexes and smart planning to keep your core under control. With reactive visuals, evolving difficulty, and powerful unlocks, <strong>Bubble UP!</strong> offers endless arcade action for score chasers and puzzle lovers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATCH<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfa8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate your center bubble to line up and match the colored bubbles as they snap to the other bubbles in your cluster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POP<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udca5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up matches at the edge of your center bubble to pop them for huge points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBO<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\u26a1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo pop chains to multiply your points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble UP!</strong> was created during Global Game Jam 2025 and has been under development since then! We have lots of fun ideas for the game and we're excited to share our progress with the community!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble UP!</strong> is a fast-paced, Tetris-inspired puzzle game where a steady stream of bubbles is drawn to your core. Match colors, pop groups, and trigger chain reactions to score big!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER FOUR CORE MECHANICS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Match bubbles</strong> by color</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Pop groups</strong> to clear space and earn points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Chain combos</strong> to multiply points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06\ufe0f <strong>Level up</strong> to unlock powerful effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRIGGER UNIQUE EVENTS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Bubble Mania</strong> kicks in when your bubble gets low, speeding up the action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf08 Bubble Frenzy</strong> activates when you level up, unleashing high-score potential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udee7\u00a0<strong>Multibubble</strong> explodes onto the screen when you clear your core completely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game speeds up, you'll need sharp reflexes and smart planning to keep your core under control. With reactive visuals, evolving difficulty, and powerful unlocks, <strong>Bubble UP!</strong> offers endless arcade action for score chasers and puzzle lovers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATCH<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfa8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate your center bubble to line up and match the colored bubbles as they snap to the other bubbles in your cluster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/1cc408404b0d976aa03d0a4d5ec93142.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POP<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udca5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up matches at the edge of your center bubble to pop them for huge points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/e1b292bbc55e0477f98c423124a49aad.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBO<strong>!\u00a0</strong>\u26a1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo pop chains to multiply your points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.poster.avif?t=1748114781\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.webm?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655340/extras/10a0fd09315d056520afcb31a0173cce.mp4?t=1748114781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble UP!</strong> was created during Global Game Jam 2025 and has been under development since then! We have lots of fun ideas for the game and we're excited to share our progress with the community!</p>",
    "short_description": "Match, pop, and combo your way to the top in this fast-paced, Tetris-inspired bubble shooter! Create explosive chain reactions to rack up points, unlock unique power-ups, and &quot;Bubble UP!&quot; through increasingly challenging levels in a vibrant arcade experience!",
